{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27325","headline":"长安秋思 · 陈标","name":"长安秋思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴女秋机织曙霜，冰蚕吐丝月盈筐。\n金刀玉指裁缝促，水殿花楼弦管长。\n舞袖慢移凝瑞雪，歌尘微动避雕梁。\n唯愁陌上芳菲度，狼籍风池荷叶黄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27325.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27325","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}